受付：INFORMATIONW</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-09-07T04:00:19" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_info_b_02_00"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どの　エリアに
ちょうせんなさいますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-01T06:26:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-01T06:26:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どの　エリアに
挑戦なさいますか？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
