		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_info_b_recovery_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょうせんの　まえに
ポケモンを　かいふくしますね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-10-26T03:53:44" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-10-25T01:40:44" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>挑戦の　前に
ポケモンを　回復しますね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
