受付：WORKMAN2</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-09-07T04:01:45" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_info_w_02_00"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どの　エリアに
ちょうせんするんだ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-01T10:49:53" />
