				Time="2011-08-22T12:06:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>え　回復したいの？▼
それなら　上の方に
ドクターが　いたよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-10-17T05:28:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
