				Time="2011-08-22T12:06:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>回復この階の上の方にいる</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="nakamura_akira:W00280"
				Time="2011-08-22T12:03:41" />
		</CommentCell>
